<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 15 bln SKR T-bills maturity Jan.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 15 bln SKR T-bills maturity Jan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office on Tuesday announced it would sell 15 billion crowns worth of Treasury bills with a maturity date of January 8, 1997.  </p>
<p>All dealers were invited to leave bids by 1000 GMT today at the latest.</p>
<p>The debt office occasionally announces T-bill auctions away from its usually weekly routine to cover short term liquidity in the market.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
